WEBVTT

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:36.890 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:39.980 line:0%
[Episode 25]

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.260 line:0%
Disrespect the fire moth,

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:44.720 line:0%
and calamity shall descend from the heavens.

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:45.520 line:0%
These words

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:49.000 line:0%
likely contain a hidden threat as well.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:51.200 line:0%
If we insist on continuing the investigation

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:53.600 line:0%
and preventing them from causing trouble,

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:55.040 line:0%
you and your loved ones

00:01:55.850 --> 00:01:57.650 line:0%
may face unexpected disasters.

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:17.260 line:0%
How could you say this to Madam?

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:17.840 line:0%
Are you deliberately

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:18.900 line:0%
trying to make her worry?

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:20.230 line:0%
With her intelligence,

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:22.879 line:0%
it would be only a matter of time before she figured it out.

00:02:22.879 --> 00:02:23.680 line:0%
-I…
-I just gave her

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:24.830 line:0%
an early reminder.

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:36.540 line:0%
♫I hope you also look up and see the radiant stars and moon♫

00:02:41.150 --> 00:02:46.830 line:0%
♫No matter how vast the world is, I'll wait for your appearance♫

00:02:49.570 --> 00:02:52.950 line:0%
♫A quick glance at each other♫

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:58.430 line:0%
♫Has warmed the winter in memories♫

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:06.420 line:0%
♫Don't mind the destined solitude, and shine brightly♫

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:12.990 line:0%
♫I'll wait until the years blossom like flowers♫

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:17.710 line:0%
♫The ice and snow slowly melted♫

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:23.280 line:0%
♫I heard those tender words♫

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:28.180 line:0%
♫He told her, "I love you"♫

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:30.250 line:0%
What's wrong?

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:33.190 line:0%
♫What I saw in my dreams♫

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:35.100 line:0%
Have you seen a doctor?

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:38.120 line:0%
♫Is not a flashy illusion♫

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:43.920 line:0%
♫I don't fear the challenges ahead, riding a white horse to chase after time♫

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:41.160 line:0%
I'm fine.

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:44.780 line:0%
Thank you for your concern.

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:48.540 line:0%
♫Let's go together♫

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:47.160 line:0%
Don't push yourself.

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:49.440 line:0%
I'll be worried.

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:54.340 line:0%
♫Love is pure and flawless, indifferent to the changes of the world♫

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:58.830 line:0%
♫Let's experience it together♫

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:02.920 line:0%
You mustn't fall ill.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:04.560 line:0%
Otherwise,

00:04:05.210 --> 00:04:07.610 line:0%
who else will make medicinal dishes for me?

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:12.090 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:15.280 line:0%
I really don't have the energy

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:16.680 line:0%
to bicker with you today.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:23.200 line:0%
Alright.

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:25.920 line:0%
I misspoke earlier.

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:29.310 line:0%
What's wrong with you?

00:04:30.820 --> 00:04:31.620 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:35.760 line:0%
I enjoy investigating cases.

00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:38.780 line:0%
I can lose myself in the pursuit of the truth.

00:04:40.959 --> 00:04:43.220 line:0%
But I don't want to drag my family into it.

00:04:46.209 --> 00:04:47.490 line:0%
The Fire Moth Sect

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:51.230 line:0%
sent me a message with the words on the corpse.

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:55.330 line:0%
They've planned everything from the start

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:58.080 line:0%
and are deliberately putting on a show for us.

00:04:58.080 --> 00:04:59.560 line:0%
They're demonstrating their power.

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:00.560 line:0%
This is a warning.

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:02.880 line:0%
You are afraid that continuing the investigation

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:04.480 line:0%
will implicate your family.

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:07.540 line:0%
Back in Xiang'an,

00:05:08.850 --> 00:05:10.750 line:0%
if we hadn't arrived in time,

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:12.040 line:0%
Sister Caiwei and the others

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:13.520 line:0%
would have already lost their lives.

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:14.280 line:0%
If...

00:05:16.530 --> 00:05:18.240 line:0%
If, while I'm in Yingzhou,

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:19.680 line:0%
they really

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:21.040 line:0%
go after my family,

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:22.280 line:0%
what should I do?

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:25.470 line:0%
I'll be far away from them.

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:28.250 line:0%
How can I ensure their safety?

00:05:35.010 --> 00:05:37.200 line:0%
I thought about it for four hours,

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:42.140 line:0%
but I just couldn't come up with a solution.

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:49.860 line:0%
If you're willing,

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:53.850 line:0%
I can send a carriage to take you back to Xiang'an.

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:57.010 line:0%
As for the matters in Yingzhou,

00:05:57.860 --> 00:05:59.790 line:0%
you don't need to worry about them.

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:00.760 line:0%
And what about you?

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:02.090 line:0%
What are you going to do?

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:04.040 line:0%
Me?

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:11.120 line:0%
Honey, do you want me

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:12.000 line:0%
to personally escort you back

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:13.320 line:0%
to your maiden home?

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:26.000 line:0%
We can't go back.

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:32.640 line:0%
You are the Grand Commander of the Imperial Security Bureau,

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:34.880 line:0%
and I am the Secretary of the Ministry of Justice.

00:06:34.880 --> 00:06:35.959 line:0%
We are here

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:37.240 line:0%
on a mission.

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:40.680 line:0%
I knew

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:43.440 line:0%
you would never leave.

00:06:48.870 --> 00:06:50.270 line:0%
A brief emotional moment

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:54.100 line:0%
wouldn't shake your passion for solving cases.

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:01.720 line:0%
Don't act like

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:03.740 line:0%
you know me so well.

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:10.470 line:0%
You've come to your senses?

00:07:11.050 --> 00:07:12.980 line:0%
This is the Yan Xing I know—

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:15.750 line:0%
sharp-tongued and unsparing.

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:16.920 line:0%
And of course,

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:18.280 line:0%
fearless in the face of authority,

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:21.280 line:0%
with a stubborn determination to charge into danger.

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:22.880 line:0%
I...

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:25.160 line:0%
I know you're worried about

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:26.420 line:0%
your family's safety.

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:32.230 line:0%
I, Shen Du, give you my word:

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:34.600 line:0%
what you fear

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:37.450 line:0%
will never happen.

00:07:39.780 --> 00:07:40.890 line:0%
Before coming Gannan Area,

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:42.090 line:0%
I made preparations.

00:07:42.360 --> 00:07:43.490 line:0%
As things stand now,

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:45.450 line:0%
everything is under control.

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:49.200 line:0%
Do you remember

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:50.459 line:0%
that letter from Xiang'an?

00:07:50.459 --> 00:07:51.720 line:0%
An urgent letter from Xiang'an?

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:53.000 line:0%
Who sent it?

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:54.600 line:0%
Madam Xu.

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:00.540 line:0%
Of course I remember.

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:03.400 line:0%
Every year during the Clothing Bestowal Festival,

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:04.640 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:05.440 line:0%
would go to

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:08.050 line:0%
Mount Li Hot Springs Villa for recuperation.

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:10.680 line:0%
She would also reward some ministers' families,

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:12.140 line:0%
allowing them to travel and rest with her.

00:08:12.140 --> 00:08:13.930 line:0%
The letter from Madam Xu informed me

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:15.230 line:0%
that she has already arranged for the Yan family

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:17.290 line:0%
to be included in the entourage list.

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:18.520 line:0%
Within Her Majesty's

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:19.720 line:0%
line of sight,

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:21.080 line:0%
I believe no sect

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:23.870 line:0%
would dare to make any reckless moves.

00:08:25.010 --> 00:08:26.940 line:0%
Well played, Shen Du.

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:32.950 line:0%
But come to think of it,

00:08:32.969 --> 00:08:34.770 line:0%
there is indeed something that,

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:36.660 line:0%
while not very important,

00:08:36.920 --> 00:08:38.130 line:0%
is still

00:08:38.400 --> 00:08:39.969 line:0%
related to you.

00:08:40.440 --> 00:08:41.240 line:0%
What is it?

00:08:41.349 --> 00:08:42.240 line:0%
About that headless corpse case,

00:08:42.240 --> 00:08:43.040 line:0%
Ji Dafu, the suspect's brother-in-law,

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:44.320 line:0%
is here.

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:45.240 line:0%
This Ji Dafu

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:46.500 line:0%
has a rather unique identity,

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:47.640 line:0%
as both the victim and the suspect

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:49.090 line:0%
are his wife's biological brothers.

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:50.200 line:0%
Please, I beg you,

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:52.010 line:0%
give me a way out, alright?

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:53.380 line:0%
[Ji Dafu]

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:53.800 line:0%
When will the case

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:56.050 line:0%
of my brother-in-law be concluded?

00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:57.160 line:0%
If the head can't be found,

00:08:57.160 --> 00:08:58.040 line:0%
I'll accept it.

00:08:58.160 --> 00:08:59.040 line:0%
Can we at least

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:01.400 line:0%
let the body be buried soon?

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:03.680 line:0%
Ji Dafu,

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:05.170 line:0%
calm down.

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:07.460 line:0%
This case is still under investigation.

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:10.920 line:0%
Governor Mo,

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:12.740 line:0%
you're looking for me?

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:14.200 line:0%
I heard you have some new suggestions

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:15.460 line:0%
about the case.

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:17.050 line:0%
There are some unusual aspects in this case

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:18.850 line:0%
which I'm still investigating.

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:20.310 line:0%
My suggestion is

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:22.260 line:0%
to combine this case with the bride case

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:23.480 line:0%
for a joint investigation.

00:09:23.480 --> 00:09:24.810 line:0%
If we combine the cases,

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:26.160 line:0%
the investigation

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:27.510 line:0%
will be further delayed.

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:28.390 line:0%
I'm afraid...

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:29.390 line:0%
Mr. Pan,

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:30.630 line:0%
what do you mean?

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:32.200 line:0%
I think your title as the top detective

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:33.440 line:0%
is undeserved.

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:34.720 line:0%
You even set a rule

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:37.240 line:0%
of never meeting with your clients face-to-face.

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:38.000 line:0%
I think you're just afraid

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:38.880 line:0%
of failing

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:40.000 line:0%
and losing face.

00:09:40.040 --> 00:09:40.760 line:0%
Today,

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:42.240 line:0%
in front of Lord Mo,

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:43.840 line:0%
give me a straightforward answer.

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:45.640 line:0%
Within five days, will you solve the case

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:46.760 line:0%
and catch the murderer?

00:09:46.760 --> 00:09:47.520 line:0%
If not,

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:48.560 line:0%
refund my money,

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:49.880 line:0%
so I can find someone more capable.

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:50.800 line:0%
If I can't solve the case,

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:52.130 line:0%
I will refund the money.

00:09:52.160 --> 00:09:52.880 line:0%
But I've almost

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:54.680 line:0%
figured out who the murderer is.

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.010 line:0%
Who is the murderer?

00:09:58.500 --> 00:09:59.770 line:0%
The murderer is...

00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:02.150 line:0%
a Half-faced Ghost.

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.450 line:0%
The ghost theory

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:05.690 line:0%
your friend used

00:10:05.800 --> 00:10:07.400 line:0%
to avoid refunding the money

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:11.320 line:0%
really worked.

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:13.260 line:0%
After hearing it, Ji Dafu

00:10:13.260 --> 00:10:15.180 line:0%
was stunned and then left.

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:17.080 line:0%
But Governor Mo

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:21.950 line:0%
wasn't so easy to fool.

00:10:31.320 --> 00:10:32.320 line:0%
Mr. Pan,

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:35.120 line:0%
I have already reported the bride case to the Ministry of Justice

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:36.200 line:0%
for case closure.

00:10:37.720 --> 00:10:38.520 line:0%
Governor Mo,

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:40.720 line:0%
I provided a new testimony.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:43.160 line:0%
I've seen it.

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:45.310 line:0%
Then why are you closing this case so hastily?

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:47.060 line:0%
Xu Jize now has a new testimony.

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:49.450 line:0%
He may be given a lighter sentence.

00:10:49.480 --> 00:10:51.320 line:0%
The eyeless corpse case is clearly a case within a case

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:53.740 line:0%
and is closely connected to the headless corpse case.

00:10:53.740 --> 00:10:54.860 line:0%
Mr. Pan,

00:10:55.270 --> 00:10:56.780 line:0%
this is not Xiang'an!

00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:02.710 line:0%
This is not Xiang'an.

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:03.720 line:0%
This is Yingzhou,

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:06.350 line:0%
which was once mired in decades of military conflict.

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:08.160 line:0%
The situation in Yingzhou is unstable.

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:09.960 line:0%
Although our country has set a governor here,

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:11.680 line:0%
Xichen is still eyeing it with great caution.

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:12.560 line:0%
Historically,

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:15.400 line:0%
it has been occupied by Xichen multiple times.

00:11:16.920 --> 00:11:18.600 line:0%
To quell the chaos in the Western Region

00:11:18.600 --> 00:11:19.960 line:0%
and prevent another war,

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:22.560 line:0%
the crucial thing is to unite the people.

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:24.360 line:0%
But do you know what we rely on

00:11:24.360 --> 00:11:26.720 line:0%
to unite them?

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:30.440 line:0%
I'd like to hear it.

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:31.400 line:0%
What we rely on

00:11:31.880 --> 00:11:33.520 line:0%
is long-term stability,

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:36.280 line:0%
strict laws to eliminate crime,

00:11:36.360 --> 00:11:37.480 line:0%
solving every case,

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:38.880 line:0%
and capturing every thief.

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:40.280 line:0%
We need to make the people believe

00:11:40.280 --> 00:11:41.720 line:0%
that as long as the officials of Cang State

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:42.800 line:0%
are in charge,

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:43.760 line:0%
Yingzhou

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:45.400 line:0%
will always be a city

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:47.460 line:0%
where the citizens can live in peace.

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:50.680 line:0%
So,

00:11:52.010 --> 00:11:54.810 line:0%
in times of chaos, heavy punishment is necessary.

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:56.260 line:0%
Xu Jize's head

00:11:56.570 --> 00:11:58.810 line:0%
is destined to hang on the city gate,

00:11:59.560 --> 00:12:00.280 line:0%
becoming the head

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:02.810 line:0%
that strikes fear in people's hearts, right?

00:12:04.930 --> 00:12:06.760 line:0%
Er Laipi is extremely vicious,

00:12:06.940 --> 00:12:08.240 line:0%
and his crimes are beyond redemption.

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:10.170 line:0%
There's no need for further investigation.

00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:11.200 line:0%
Xu Jize,

00:12:11.530 --> 00:12:13.520 line:0%
who raped a married woman,

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:15.560 line:0%
deserves an even harsher punishment.

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:16.920 line:0%
Violating the laws of the frontier

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:18.120 line:0%
is a capital offense.

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:21.400 line:0%
However, I can promise you

00:12:22.310 --> 00:12:23.910 line:0%
that he will die peacefully,

00:12:24.500 --> 00:12:25.740 line:0%
without becoming

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:27.740 line:0%
the head hanging on the city gate.

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:29.560 line:0%
You told me all this

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:32.040 line:0%
in such detail

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:34.440 line:0%
not just to tell me

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:37.240 line:0%
how embarrassed Pan Chi was today, right?

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:44.000 line:0%
You want to tell me

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:46.940 line:0%
that I should understand Governor Mo's

00:12:46.940 --> 00:12:48.440 line:0%
intervention in the case

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:50.790 line:0%
and his urgency in reaching a quick conclusion.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:52.060 line:0%
His position means

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:54.570 line:0%
he cannot, like us,

00:12:54.720 --> 00:12:57.320 line:0%
focus solely on pursuing the truth of the case.

00:12:57.480 --> 00:12:58.760 line:0%
You're reminding me

00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:00.760 line:0%
to pay more attention to

00:13:00.780 --> 00:13:02.510 line:0%
Governor Mo's situation

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:04.360 line:0%
and not to doubt

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:06.220 line:0%
that he has a heart for the people.

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:12.200 line:0%
I want to tell you

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:15.520 line:0%
that people are complex,

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:19.730 line:0%
and we shouldn't jump to conclusions so quickly.

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:22.100 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:25.000 line:0%
Shen Du?

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:27.910 line:0%
How much do you

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:29.440 line:0%
trust Mo Qianzhi?

00:13:32.850 --> 00:13:35.180 line:0%
He used to be the person I trusted the most.

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:36.780 line:0%
And now?

00:13:39.240 --> 00:13:40.340 line:0%
Now...

00:13:44.810 --> 00:13:45.860 line:0%
Now...

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:53.780 line:0%
he is the person I most want to trust.

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:04.400 line:0%
To uncover the truth,

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:06.000 line:0%
one must inevitably go through the process

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:07.600 line:0%
you're going through now.

00:14:07.620 --> 00:14:09.680 line:0%
No matter how small the detail

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:11.850 line:0%
or how close the person,

00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:14.440 line:0%
first, don't be afraid to doubt;

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:16.760 line:0%
you must have the courage to verify them.

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:17.930 line:0%
Trust

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:19.230 line:0%
can also be

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:22.750 line:0%
a force in investigation.

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:30.000 line:0%
The Fire Moth Sect has deep roots in Yingzhou.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.130 line:0%
Shen has a close relationship with Mo.

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:49.860 line:0%
[Jiang's Mansion]

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:45.240 line:0%
-Go.
-Please take another look.

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:45.760 line:0%
Go!

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:47.480 line:0%
-Please take another look.
-Go!

00:14:47.480 --> 00:14:48.640 line:0%
Stop talking.

00:14:48.640 --> 00:14:49.560 line:0%
-Go!
-Take another look!

00:14:49.560 --> 00:14:50.640 line:0%
Leave now!

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:00.250 line:0%
[Jiang's Mansion]

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:25.920 line:0%
Sir.

00:15:26.660 --> 00:15:27.720 line:0%
Please bring me another pot of wine.

00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:28.440 line:0%
Certainly.

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:34.040 line:0%
Yan Xing?

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:35.640 line:0%
Why are you here?

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:39.450 line:0%
Why are you here?

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:51.880 line:0%
Take a look.

00:15:53.280 --> 00:15:54.520 line:0%
Sir, take a look.

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:58.420 line:0%
[Grain]

00:15:56.480 --> 00:15:57.480 line:0%
Take a look.

00:15:57.690 --> 00:15:59.190 line:0%
These are all new styles.

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:01.640 line:0%
Lady Xing,

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:03.240 line:0%
what are you doing here?

00:16:03.240 --> 00:16:04.200 line:0%
I...

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:07.040 line:0%
came to walk my pigeon.

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:09.520 line:0%
Walk your pigeon?

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:15.240 line:0%
Sixth Lady,

00:16:16.440 --> 00:16:17.480 line:0%
do you know

00:16:17.840 --> 00:16:19.640 line:0%
that the specialty of this restaurant

00:16:19.640 --> 00:16:20.800 line:0%
is roasted pigeon?

00:16:24.720 --> 00:16:26.040 line:0%
But speaking of which,

00:16:28.560 --> 00:16:29.620 line:0%
isn't it a bit cruel

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:31.080 line:0%
to do this

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:32.080 line:0%
to the pigeon?

00:16:37.480 --> 00:16:39.280 line:0%
Making it watch with its own eyes

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:41.610 line:0%
that it'll inevitably face death.

00:16:48.680 --> 00:16:49.480 line:0%
A toast

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:53.360 line:0%
to this poor pigeon.

00:16:57.880 --> 00:16:59.600 line:0%
You're not here drowning your sorrows

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:00.480 line:0%
in alcohol

00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:02.810 line:0%
because Ji Dafu said you were incompetent

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:04.760 line:0%
this afternoon, are you?

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:11.389 line:0%
Indeed, good news doesn't travel far,

00:17:11.389 --> 00:17:12.800 line:0%
but bad news spreads quickly.

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:13.760 line:0%
Ji Dafu is nothing

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:14.629 line:0%
in my eyes.

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:15.800 line:0%
His words

00:17:16.440 --> 00:17:18.240 line:0%
are not worth me taking to heart.

00:17:19.240 --> 00:17:20.440 line:0%
So, is this because of

00:17:20.909 --> 00:17:21.909 line:0%
the case closing?

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:23.000 line:0%
I heard that about the bride case,

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:24.520 line:0%
you got new testimonies.

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:25.780 line:0%
Did you find anything?

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:28.930 line:0%
Found anything?

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:31.360 line:0%
No, nothing.

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:33.760 line:0%
They're just some useless testimonies.

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:34.560 line:0%
However,

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:37.400 line:0%
to gather the evidence,

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:40.200 line:0%
I went to the prison to visit Xu Jize.

00:17:40.320 --> 00:17:41.760 line:0%
After questioning him,

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:43.520 line:0%
when I was about to leave,

00:17:43.600 --> 00:17:45.110 line:0%
he suddenly said to me—

00:17:45.680 --> 00:17:46.860 line:0%
Mr. Pan.

00:17:47.400 --> 00:17:48.080 line:0%
You're also

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:50.480 line:0%
a scholar with a humble background, right?

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:52.380 line:0%
With your courage and eloquence,

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:54.480 line:0%
why aren't you an official in the Ministry of Justice,

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:56.040 line:0%
but rather some kind of

00:17:56.040 --> 00:17:57.630 line:0%
folk detective?

00:17:58.120 --> 00:17:59.640 line:0%
Let me make a bold guess.

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:02.360 line:0%
You and I are the same kind of people,

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:05.540 line:0%
burdened by our humble origins.

00:18:05.590 --> 00:18:08.180 line:0%
[Huang's Mansion]

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:13.920 line:0%
Please don't close the door.

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:14.680 line:0%
My poetry has already been

00:18:14.680 --> 00:18:16.640 line:0%
submitted to your office for more than a month.

00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:19.040 line:0%
Has Senior Minister Huang reviewed it yet?

00:18:20.470 --> 00:18:22.040 line:0%
What a stubborn stray dog.

00:18:22.040 --> 00:18:23.040 line:0%
With his pathetic appearance,

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:25.770 line:0%
he actually expects our master to recommend him.

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:37.950 line:0%
[Huang's Mansion]

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:42.120 line:0%
Our paths are different.

00:18:42.880 --> 00:18:44.800 line:0%
No matter how much resentment I have,

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:45.560 line:0%
I would never

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:47.120 line:0%
vent my frustration on the weak.

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:47.880 line:0%
The weak?

00:18:48.320 --> 00:18:48.960 line:0%
No.

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:52.080 line:0%
I never bully the weak.

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:54.210 line:0%
I only bully

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:55.640 line:0%
the noble families

00:18:55.640 --> 00:18:57.360 line:0%
who have been suppressing and humiliating

00:18:57.360 --> 00:18:58.800 line:0%
the humble families!

00:18:59.520 --> 00:19:01.720 line:0%
They are born into positions of power,

00:19:01.840 --> 00:19:03.480 line:0%
treating us from humble backgrounds

00:19:03.480 --> 00:19:04.760 line:0%
as their servants.

00:19:07.320 --> 00:19:09.670 line:0%
I did defile one of their brides.

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:11.800 line:0%
I just wanted them to taste

00:19:11.820 --> 00:19:13.420 line:0%
the flavor of humiliation.

00:19:14.650 --> 00:19:16.040 line:0%
The taste that we,

00:19:16.410 --> 00:19:19.020 line:0%
the scholars from humble backgrounds,

00:19:19.520 --> 00:19:22.920 line:0%
have been bitterly swallowing every day for a hundred years.

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:27.500 line:0%
Now that things have come to this point,

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:29.560 line:0%
you still don't think you were wrong?

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:36.160 line:0%
I do.

00:19:37.010 --> 00:19:39.210 line:0%
Yes. In the case of Lady Du,

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:41.730 line:0%
I made the mistake of not investigating thoroughly.

00:19:41.730 --> 00:19:43.410 line:0%
By "not investigating thoroughly,"

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:45.360 line:0%
you mean that at the beginning of the case,

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:46.080 line:0%
you realized that the Li family

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:48.100 line:0%
couldn't be considered a gentry family, right?

00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:50.050 line:0%
As expected of the top detective.

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:52.180 line:0%
After Lady Du was taken away,

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:53.610 line:0%
Er Laipi said

00:19:53.640 --> 00:19:56.040 line:0%
that the Li family was a wealthy household.

00:19:56.620 --> 00:19:59.170 line:0%
Originally, it was Li Hongfa

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:02.000 line:0%
who started with a small business and made a fortune.

00:20:02.000 --> 00:20:02.720 line:0%
But he was determined

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:04.650 line:0%
to have his son enter officialdom.

00:20:04.960 --> 00:20:05.940 line:0%
Just because

00:20:06.040 --> 00:20:08.440 line:0%
merchants are the lowest class in society,

00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:10.790 line:0%
Li Zimo was like me.

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:13.480 line:0%
Later, Li Hongfa spent a lot of money

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:16.420 line:0%
to whitewash himself

00:20:16.490 --> 00:20:19.550 line:0%
with a fake identity as a descendant of a gentry family.

00:20:19.880 --> 00:20:20.720 line:0%
Then Li Zimo

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:22.390 line:0%
was able to take the exam.

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:23.960 line:0%
So, in the end, you decided

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:25.070 line:0%
to stop committing the crime

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:26.900 line:0%
and started arguing with Er Laipi.

00:20:26.900 --> 00:20:27.540 line:0%
Yes.

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:29.650 line:0%
We had a fierce argument.

00:20:29.800 --> 00:20:30.670 line:0%
Later, we realized

00:20:30.670 --> 00:20:32.600 line:0%
we were being followed, so we stopped arguing.

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:34.520 line:0%
But from the beginning,

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:35.980 line:0%
I always wanted

00:20:36.010 --> 00:20:37.140 line:0%
to send Lady Du back.

00:20:37.470 --> 00:20:39.670 line:0%
Who knew we'd stumble upon a murder case?

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:42.050 line:0%
I really didn't kill Er Laipi.

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:42.960 line:0%
And I

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:44.980 line:0%
sent Du Xiaowan back almost unscathed.

00:20:44.980 --> 00:20:45.880 line:0%
I'll report

00:20:45.880 --> 00:20:47.400 line:0%
what you said today truthfully

00:20:47.400 --> 00:20:48.800 line:0%
for sentencing.

00:20:49.320 --> 00:20:50.520 line:0%
According to the law,

00:20:51.050 --> 00:20:53.010 line:0%
you might get a lighter sentence.

00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:54.700 line:0%
But in my heart,

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:56.160 line:0%
you are nothing but

00:20:56.160 --> 00:20:57.640 line:0%
an absolute coward.

00:20:58.290 --> 00:20:59.490 line:0%
The brave

00:20:59.920 --> 00:21:01.720 line:0%
get angry at the stronger,

00:21:01.750 --> 00:21:03.160 line:0%
while the cowardly

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:04.800 line:0%
get angry at the weaker.

00:21:05.080 --> 00:21:06.600 line:0%
You didn't dare to confront the powerful forces

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:07.940 line:0%
that had been oppressing you.

00:21:07.940 --> 00:21:09.200 line:0%
Instead, you turn your attention

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:11.120 line:0%
to defenseless women.

00:21:12.400 --> 00:21:13.810 line:0%
That wasn't revenge.

00:21:14.360 --> 00:21:15.280 line:0%
You're just a coward

00:21:15.280 --> 00:21:17.240 line:0%
who only bullies kind people.

00:21:22.500 --> 00:21:23.530 line:0%
The sentencing

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:26.120 line:0%
is already over.

00:21:26.140 --> 00:21:27.940 line:0%
I'm certain to die.

00:21:28.950 --> 00:21:30.670 line:0%
You just came to Yingzhou

00:21:30.710 --> 00:21:32.750 line:0%
and don't know much about Governor Mo.

00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:34.700 line:0%
From the day I got here,

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:37.090 line:0%
I never expected to leave alive.

00:21:37.850 --> 00:21:39.100 line:0%
You're right.

00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:40.520 line:0%
I brought this upon myself.

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:41.680 line:0%
I dug my own grave.

00:21:41.720 --> 00:21:42.520 line:0%
No.

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:45.680 line:0%
I shouldn't have been born into this world.

00:21:51.070 --> 00:21:52.580 line:0%
In the next life,

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:55.920 line:0%
I would rather be

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:58.300 line:0%
an illiterate peasant

00:22:01.120 --> 00:22:03.040 line:0%
than a scholar

00:22:04.270 --> 00:22:06.220 line:0%
who only understands things

00:22:07.670 --> 00:22:09.190 line:0%
roughly.

00:22:26.680 --> 00:22:27.960 line:0%
Stop drinking.

00:22:31.560 --> 00:22:32.280 line:0%
Sir,

00:22:32.280 --> 00:22:34.140 line:0%
don't serve him any more alcohol.

00:22:34.360 --> 00:22:36.360 line:0%
Bring him a bowl of lamb noodle soup.

00:22:36.600 --> 00:22:37.800 line:0%
Alright, sure thing.

00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:48.960 line:0%
Here you go.

00:22:50.600 --> 00:22:52.440 line:0%
The lamb from Gannan Area

00:22:52.520 --> 00:22:54.040 line:0%
is famously delicious.

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:54.840 line:0%
Trust me,

00:22:55.160 --> 00:22:56.920 line:0%
rather than drowning your sorrows in alcohol,

00:22:56.920 --> 00:22:58.920 line:0%
it's better to soothe them with a bowl of soup noodles.

00:22:58.920 --> 00:22:59.720 line:0%
Give it a try.

00:23:20.720 --> 00:23:21.520 line:0%
How is it?

00:23:22.840 --> 00:23:24.000 line:0%
The taste is indeed quite good.

00:23:24.000 --> 00:23:25.860 line:0%
See? I didn't lie to you, didn't I?

00:23:30.410 --> 00:23:33.140 line:0%
Laughing heartily to the sky,

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:36.450 line:0%
I stride across the divine land.

00:23:37.500 --> 00:23:39.960 line:0%
Though the noble deem themselves precious,

00:23:40.990 --> 00:23:43.080 line:0%
I see them as mere dust.

00:23:43.300 --> 00:23:45.900 line:0%
Though the humble consider themselves lowly,

00:23:46.160 --> 00:23:48.640 line:0%
who's to say they're not worth a thousand gold?

00:23:48.640 --> 00:23:51.360 line:0%
I shake my robes and gaze upon the mountains,

00:23:51.540 --> 00:23:53.400 line:0%
washing my feet in the long river.

00:23:55.600 --> 00:23:56.400 line:0%
Sixth Lady,

00:23:57.060 --> 00:23:58.920 line:0%
why did you suddenly recite this?

00:23:59.870 --> 00:24:01.410 line:0%
I just feel that

00:24:01.600 --> 00:24:04.190 line:0%
this manifesto is bold and grand.

00:24:04.650 --> 00:24:07.130 line:0%
With just a few words, it exposes the fact

00:24:07.160 --> 00:24:08.690 line:0%
that scholars from humble backgrounds are being oppressed.

00:24:08.690 --> 00:24:09.950 line:0%
It's so invigorating.

00:24:10.060 --> 00:24:11.290 line:0%
Once this poem was made,

00:24:11.290 --> 00:24:13.590 line:0%
it spread across the teahouses and taverns of the Imperial City.

00:24:13.590 --> 00:24:15.260 line:0%
During those days,

00:24:15.280 --> 00:24:17.000 line:0%
the sons of noble families in Xiang'an City

00:24:17.000 --> 00:24:18.260 line:0%
didn't even dare to be too ostentatious

00:24:18.260 --> 00:24:19.670 line:0%
when dining out,

00:24:19.800 --> 00:24:22.860 line:0%
afraid of provoking the simmering public resentment.

00:24:24.720 --> 00:24:26.140 line:0%
With all this buildup,

00:24:26.520 --> 00:24:27.320 line:0%
you're surely not just

00:24:27.320 --> 00:24:28.520 line:0%
trying to flatter my literary talent, right?

00:24:28.520 --> 00:24:30.180 line:0%
Of course, it's not just that.

00:24:30.720 --> 00:24:32.720 line:0%
There's one more thing I want to praise you for.

00:24:32.720 --> 00:24:34.440 line:0%
I admire your courage.

00:24:35.080 --> 00:24:36.800 line:0%
As long as one retains the courage

00:24:36.800 --> 00:24:38.880 line:0%
to challenge decayed authority,

00:24:38.900 --> 00:24:40.400 line:0%
sometimes just a single word

00:24:40.400 --> 00:24:41.700 line:0%
or poem

00:24:41.760 --> 00:24:43.600 line:0%
can carry great power.

00:24:46.080 --> 00:24:46.880 line:0%
I know that

00:24:47.400 --> 00:24:49.520 line:0%
the current situation of the humble families in Cang State

00:24:49.520 --> 00:24:51.010 line:0%
is disappointing you.

00:24:51.200 --> 00:24:51.920 line:0%
But as long as each

00:24:51.920 --> 00:24:53.160 line:0%
and every one of us doesn't give up,

00:24:53.160 --> 00:24:54.240 line:0%
I believe there will come a day

00:24:54.240 --> 00:24:55.320 line:0%
when the clouds part and the sun shines

00:24:55.320 --> 00:24:56.760 line:0%
on the scholars

00:24:56.760 --> 00:24:58.220 line:0%
from humble backgrounds.

00:25:06.640 --> 00:25:07.660 line:0%
I don't know

00:25:08.320 --> 00:25:10.760 line:0%
if it's because this bowl of noodles is so delicious

00:25:10.760 --> 00:25:12.400 line:0%
or your words

00:25:13.030 --> 00:25:14.690 line:0%
have had an inspiring effect,

00:25:15.200 --> 00:25:17.120 line:0%
but I now feel refreshed

00:25:17.720 --> 00:25:19.580 line:0%
and could investigate 10 more cases.

00:25:19.580 --> 00:25:20.560 line:0%
No, no, no.

00:25:20.880 --> 00:25:21.880 line:0%
There can't be any more cases

00:25:21.880 --> 00:25:23.080 line:0%
in Gannan Area.

00:25:23.080 --> 00:25:23.720 line:0%
You're already

00:25:23.720 --> 00:25:24.320 line:0%
so busy with investigations

00:25:24.320 --> 00:25:25.600 line:0%
that you have no time to rest.

00:25:25.600 --> 00:25:26.480 line:0%
If more cases come up,

00:25:26.480 --> 00:25:28.410 line:0%
you really won't be able to keep up.

00:25:33.160 --> 00:25:34.220 line:0%
There's something

00:25:35.040 --> 00:25:36.370 line:0%
I still want to tell you.

00:25:38.480 --> 00:25:39.810 line:0%
If you're being abused,

00:25:40.120 --> 00:25:41.650 line:0%
you don't have to endure it.

00:25:41.800 --> 00:25:42.600 line:0%
Who says that

00:25:42.640 --> 00:25:43.840 line:0%
the White Ghost's mansion

00:25:43.840 --> 00:25:45.280 line:0%
is a place you can enter but can't leave?

00:25:45.280 --> 00:25:46.080 line:0%
In my opinion,

00:25:46.240 --> 00:25:48.160 line:0%
Shen Du is just a paper tiger.

00:25:48.280 --> 00:25:49.280 line:0%
Just say the word,

00:25:49.520 --> 00:25:50.480 line:0%
and I, Pan Chi,

00:25:50.480 --> 00:25:51.800 line:0%
will risk any danger

00:25:52.160 --> 00:25:53.720 line:0%
to help you out of this misery.

00:25:53.720 --> 00:25:56.380 line:0%
You... you must have misunderstood something.

00:25:56.560 --> 00:25:57.840 line:0%
No one is abusing me.

00:25:58.100 --> 00:25:59.490 line:0%
No one is abusing you?

00:25:59.680 --> 00:26:00.520 line:0%
Then how did you get that wound

00:26:00.520 --> 00:26:01.520 line:0%
on your forehead?

00:26:03.070 --> 00:26:04.390 line:0%
Every time I see you,

00:26:04.480 --> 00:26:06.360 line:0%
there are always wounds on you.

00:26:06.710 --> 00:26:09.110 line:0%
Could it be that you didn't get them at home?

00:26:11.400 --> 00:26:14.220 line:0%
It's true that I got them at home.

00:26:22.980 --> 00:26:25.180 line:0%
How should I explain this to you?

00:26:26.250 --> 00:26:27.200 line:0%
Anyway,

00:26:27.380 --> 00:26:29.460 line:0%
Shen Du really isn't mistreating me.

00:26:36.510 --> 00:26:38.240 line:0%
Although my marrying into the Shen family as a replacement bride

00:26:38.240 --> 00:26:39.320 line:0%
was a bit absurd

00:26:39.340 --> 00:26:40.790 line:0%
and not what he wanted,

00:26:41.880 --> 00:26:43.370 line:0%
overall,

00:26:44.120 --> 00:26:46.010 line:0%
Shen Du has been a decent husband.

00:26:46.120 --> 00:26:47.080 line:0%
He takes good care

00:26:47.080 --> 00:26:48.240 line:0%
of me and my family.

00:26:52.480 --> 00:26:53.610 line:0%
Besides,

00:26:53.650 --> 00:26:55.790 line:0%
I will eventually leave him.

00:26:58.270 --> 00:26:59.720 line:0%
Both Shen Du

00:26:59.920 --> 00:27:00.930 line:0%
and I

00:27:01.880 --> 00:27:03.290 line:0%
are well aware

00:27:03.470 --> 00:27:05.300 line:0%
that this day will come soon.

00:27:15.960 --> 00:27:16.760 line:0%
Why?

00:27:20.560 --> 00:27:21.440 line:0%
Because there has always been

00:27:21.440 --> 00:27:22.900 line:0%
someone else in his heart.

00:27:23.200 --> 00:27:24.600 line:0%
And that person is not me.

00:27:25.220 --> 00:27:26.610 line:0%
This position

00:27:27.020 --> 00:27:28.660 line:0%
was never meant for me.

00:27:41.440 --> 00:27:42.240 line:0%
Madam,

00:27:42.260 --> 00:27:44.040 line:0%
considering how busy you've been with work lately,

00:27:44.040 --> 00:27:44.640 line:0%
Governor Mo has kindly arranged for you

00:27:44.640 --> 00:27:46.000 line:0%
to visit the most famous hot springs in Yingzhou,

00:27:46.000 --> 00:27:47.360 line:0%
Yixi Pond, to relax and bathe.

00:27:47.360 --> 00:27:48.160 line:0%
Young lady,

00:27:48.480 --> 00:27:49.400 line:0%
our Yixi Pond

00:27:49.400 --> 00:27:51.960 line:0%
is no worse than the royal family's Mount Li Hot Springs.

00:27:51.960 --> 00:27:53.240 line:0%
It's fed by thousand-year-old spring water

00:27:53.240 --> 00:27:54.440 line:0%
from Xiling Mountain

00:27:54.440 --> 00:27:56.120 line:0%
and enhanced by natural geothermal heat,

00:27:56.120 --> 00:27:57.560 line:0%
with dozens of different herbs

00:27:57.560 --> 00:27:58.880 line:0%
in the pond.

00:27:59.050 --> 00:28:00.640 line:0%
For men, it strengthens the kidneys and replenishes Yang energy;

00:28:00.640 --> 00:28:02.320 line:0%
for women, it enhances beauty and nourishes the skin.

00:28:02.320 --> 00:28:04.580 line:0%
Its effectiveness is widely acclaimed.

00:28:05.850 --> 00:28:07.440 line:0%
Within a hundred miles of Gannan Area,

00:28:07.440 --> 00:28:08.800 line:0%
all couples hoping for children

00:28:08.800 --> 00:28:10.080 line:0%
specifically come to bathe

00:28:10.080 --> 00:28:10.920 line:0%
in this pond.

00:28:12.520 --> 00:28:13.840 line:0%
Thank you for the explanation.

00:28:13.840 --> 00:28:15.570 line:0%
You've worked hard guiding me.

00:28:15.650 --> 00:28:16.980 line:0%
You may take a break now.

00:28:17.020 --> 00:28:18.020 line:0%
Oh no, I can't.

00:28:18.120 --> 00:28:18.760 line:0%
I haven't served you

00:28:18.760 --> 00:28:20.560 line:0%
in putting on your silk robe yet.

00:28:43.160 --> 00:28:43.960 line:0%
Who's there?

00:28:46.610 --> 00:28:47.410 line:0%
It's me.

00:28:51.750 --> 00:28:53.060 line:0%
Why are you here?

00:28:55.280 --> 00:28:56.200 line:0%
Naturally...

00:28:58.390 --> 00:28:59.650 line:0%
I'm here to take a bath.

00:28:59.940 --> 00:29:01.620 line:0%
This is the women's bath.

00:29:02.120 --> 00:29:04.030 line:0%
You should go to another pond.

00:29:04.280 --> 00:29:05.810 line:0%
Yixi Pond only has one pond.

00:29:05.970 --> 00:29:08.160 line:0%
There's no separation for men and women.

00:29:08.160 --> 00:29:09.160 line:0%
Besides, the Yingzhou government arranged

00:29:09.160 --> 00:29:10.690 line:0%
for us to bathe together as a married couple.

00:29:10.690 --> 00:29:12.020 line:0%
If we bathe separately,

00:29:12.240 --> 00:29:13.600 line:0%
won't it be too strange?

00:29:13.870 --> 00:29:15.930 line:0%
What would the people outside think?

00:29:15.960 --> 00:29:17.120 line:0%
The people outside?

00:29:17.120 --> 00:29:18.480 line:0%
There are a few housemaids and servants

00:29:18.480 --> 00:29:19.360 line:0%
watching.

00:29:20.160 --> 00:29:21.620 line:0%
Even if it's just for show,

00:29:22.480 --> 00:29:24.050 line:0%
I should bathe with you.

00:29:46.160 --> 00:29:47.220 line:0%
I'm getting in now.

00:29:48.520 --> 00:29:49.940 line:0%
Wait, wait!

00:29:50.000 --> 00:29:51.320 line:0%
Don't get in yet.

00:29:51.340 --> 00:29:52.720 line:0%
Turn your back

00:29:52.960 --> 00:29:54.270 line:0%
and close your eyes.

00:30:08.840 --> 00:30:10.040 line:0%
Are you too shy

00:30:10.570 --> 00:30:12.030 line:0%
to bathe with me?

00:30:12.050 --> 00:30:13.260 line:0%
I'm not!

00:30:15.320 --> 00:30:17.200 line:0%
I'm just afraid you'll be awkward

00:30:17.230 --> 00:30:18.970 line:0%
and make me feel embarrassed.

00:30:27.260 --> 00:30:29.150 line:0%
Okay, you can open your eyes now.

00:30:30.040 --> 00:30:30.840 line:0%
Get in now.

00:30:35.750 --> 00:30:37.570 line:0%
I can't see anything now.

00:30:37.590 --> 00:30:39.050 line:0%
Where should I get in from?

00:30:39.800 --> 00:30:40.600 line:0%
Oh no.

00:30:40.630 --> 00:30:41.880 line:0%
His eyesight is poor.

00:30:41.910 --> 00:30:43.120 line:0%
I should've left a light on for him

00:30:43.120 --> 00:30:44.880 line:0%
and waited until he came down before blowing it out.

00:30:44.880 --> 00:30:45.680 line:0%
Wait there.

00:30:46.440 --> 00:30:47.480 line:0%
I'll help you.

00:31:16.850 --> 00:31:17.680 line:0%
You said someone

00:31:17.680 --> 00:31:19.210 line:0%
has always been in my heart.

00:31:19.560 --> 00:31:20.620 line:0%
Who is that person?

00:31:22.080 --> 00:31:23.030 line:0%
Mo Xiuxiu?

00:31:23.440 --> 00:31:24.240 line:0%
No.

00:31:24.640 --> 00:31:25.920 line:0%
That would expose the fact

00:31:25.920 --> 00:31:28.320 line:0%
that I overheard him talking to Mo Qianzhi.

00:31:30.900 --> 00:31:32.120 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:31:32.830 --> 00:31:34.540 line:0%
why did you eavesdrop on me?

00:31:35.590 --> 00:31:36.520 line:0%
Couldn't you just

00:31:36.520 --> 00:31:38.000 line:0%
ask me frankly?

00:31:38.100 --> 00:31:38.900 line:0%
If I ask now,

00:31:42.370 --> 00:31:43.700 line:0%
will you dare to answer?

00:31:47.240 --> 00:31:48.700 line:0%
Of course, I will.

00:31:50.170 --> 00:31:51.800 line:0%
I have always heard that

00:31:51.800 --> 00:31:54.430 line:0%
you have a reputation for not being fond of women.

00:31:54.430 --> 00:31:56.460 line:0%
I completely agree with that.

00:31:56.940 --> 00:31:58.010 line:0%
In Shen's Mansion,

00:31:58.200 --> 00:32:00.120 line:0%
there are no concubines,

00:32:00.360 --> 00:32:02.290 line:0%
and even female servants are rare.

00:32:02.520 --> 00:32:03.800 line:0%
Moreover,

00:32:04.360 --> 00:32:06.840 line:0%
you've shown dislike towards me many times.

00:32:08.670 --> 00:32:10.200 line:0%
Doesn't this say enough?

00:32:11.250 --> 00:32:12.740 line:0%
I stay away from women

00:32:13.590 --> 00:32:15.360 line:0%
because there's already

00:32:15.380 --> 00:32:16.660 line:0%
a girl I like.

00:32:28.750 --> 00:32:30.330 line:0%
So I misunderstood you.

00:32:46.720 --> 00:32:47.720 line:0%
I met her

00:32:49.800 --> 00:32:50.960 line:0%
when we were kids.

00:32:55.360 --> 00:32:56.440 line:0%
I still keep her

00:32:56.440 --> 00:32:57.640 line:0%
woven pig figurine.

00:33:00.540 --> 00:33:01.560 line:0%
Because of her,

00:33:03.060 --> 00:33:04.640 line:0%
I managed to survive in

00:33:04.640 --> 00:33:05.970 line:0%
the Prisoner's Center.

00:33:06.700 --> 00:33:07.500 line:0%
Yes.

00:33:08.080 --> 00:33:10.200 line:0%
Thanks to Mo Xiuxiu's brother pleading for him,

00:33:10.200 --> 00:33:11.760 line:0%
he was spared the death penalty

00:33:11.760 --> 00:33:13.690 line:0%
and sent to the Prisoner's Center.

00:33:15.420 --> 00:33:16.990 line:0%
Every night,

00:33:20.890 --> 00:33:22.980 line:0%
she sneaked into the back garden

00:33:24.840 --> 00:33:26.840 line:0%
and brought me comfort and food.

00:33:36.330 --> 00:33:38.260 line:0%
In those days of endless darkness,

00:33:39.380 --> 00:33:40.320 line:0%
she was the light

00:33:40.320 --> 00:33:42.380 line:0%
I desperately longed for each night.

00:33:44.500 --> 00:33:45.560 line:0%
I didn't even know

00:33:45.560 --> 00:33:46.920 line:0%
her name

00:33:48.900 --> 00:33:51.100 line:0%
or see her face clearly.

00:33:57.460 --> 00:33:59.570 line:0%
The only gift I gave her

00:34:03.720 --> 00:34:05.280 line:0%
was a copper whistle.

00:34:08.300 --> 00:34:10.560 line:0%
This whistle was given to me by my father.

00:34:33.810 --> 00:34:35.420 line:0%
I remember she told me

00:34:36.150 --> 00:34:37.150 line:0%
that one day,

00:34:38.430 --> 00:34:40.650 line:0%
she would take me out aboveboard.

00:34:40.840 --> 00:34:42.050 line:0%
One day,

00:34:42.200 --> 00:34:43.959 line:0%
I will clear the Shen family's name

00:34:43.959 --> 00:34:46.229 line:0%
and get you out of here aboveboard.

00:34:50.760 --> 00:34:52.220 line:0%
For many years after that,

00:34:55.120 --> 00:34:56.600 line:0%
I never saw her again.

00:34:58.130 --> 00:35:00.590 line:0%
She seemed to have vanished without a trace.

00:35:01.080 --> 00:35:02.270 line:0%
Until one day,

00:35:05.100 --> 00:35:07.310 line:0%
as if by fate,

00:35:10.480 --> 00:35:12.060 line:0%
she became my wife.

00:35:25.320 --> 00:35:29.370 line:0%
♫The night is still young, and the moonlight reflects on the west window♫

00:35:29.290 --> 00:35:30.500 line:0%
But ironically,

00:35:30.750 --> 00:35:33.440 line:0%
♫There are stars in your eyes♫

00:35:32.680 --> 00:35:33.680 line:0%
at that time,

00:35:34.420 --> 00:35:35.610 line:0%
♫When I touch you♫

00:35:34.560 --> 00:35:35.850 line:0%
I didn't even know

00:35:35.880 --> 00:35:37.320 line:0%
she was the girl from my memories.

00:35:36.330 --> 00:35:39.430 line:0%
♫My heart is like a flickering candlelight, shaking and swaying♫

00:35:40.840 --> 00:35:45.050 line:0%
♫The more I care, the deeper I hide♫

00:35:41.300 --> 00:35:42.600 line:0%
Later, I found out.

00:35:44.770 --> 00:35:46.280 line:0%
I hope it was not too late.

00:35:46.300 --> 00:35:50.880 line:0%
♫Leaves turn yellow and fall, and my thoughts run in thousands of lines♫

00:35:51.640 --> 00:35:54.780 line:0%
♫Time is like a poem, romantic and sorrowful♫

00:35:53.130 --> 00:35:54.420 line:0%
I want to tell her

00:35:55.370 --> 00:35:57.090 line:0%
♫Two hearts♫

00:35:56.930 --> 00:35:58.010 line:0%
that in my heart,

00:35:57.830 --> 00:36:01.010 line:0%
♫Collide between dawn and dusk♫

00:35:59.530 --> 00:36:00.830 line:0%
from the beginning,

00:36:01.680 --> 00:36:05.960 line:0%
♫The embrace came as a surprise♫

00:36:04.060 --> 00:36:05.460 line:0%
it has always been her.

00:36:19.020 --> 00:36:23.290 line:0%
♫Every memory, I hold it dear♫

00:36:24.280 --> 00:36:27.410 line:0%
♫From desolation, it has become a poem♫

00:36:28.040 --> 00:36:29.500 line:0%
♫Looking back♫

00:36:30.390 --> 00:36:33.450 line:0%
♫We passed through the misty rain and waited for the sunny day♫

00:36:34.630 --> 00:36:39.080 line:0%
♫Love ripples in each other's eyes♫

00:36:40.330 --> 00:36:44.720 line:0%
♫You have long melted the frost in my heart♫

00:36:45.720 --> 00:36:48.820 line:0%
♫So many words to say, but the paper isn't long enough♫

00:36:49.600 --> 00:36:50.950 line:0%
♫Every day♫

00:36:51.820 --> 00:36:54.970 line:0%
♫We test and probe each other♫

00:36:55.550 --> 00:36:59.870 line:0%
♫And before we knew it, we reached forever♫

00:37:01.110 --> 00:37:03.780 line:0%
♫I want to be with you, side by side♫

00:37:04.340 --> 00:37:07.540 line:0%
♫I want to keep you by my side♫

00:37:08.380 --> 00:37:11.460 line:0%
♫Through the obstacle of wind and rain♫

00:37:12.290 --> 00:37:14.440 line:0%
♫I want to be your moonlight♫

00:37:14.990 --> 00:37:18.350 line:0%
♫Accompany you until every dawn♫

00:37:18.690 --> 00:37:20.780 line:0%
♫How I wish♫

00:37:21.500 --> 00:37:24.630 line:0%
♫I could just forget the passage of time like this♫

00:37:25.540 --> 00:37:28.120 line:0%
♫I want to be with you, side by side♫

00:37:28.730 --> 00:37:31.810 line:0%
♫May we never forget each other♫

00:37:32.570 --> 00:37:35.890 line:0%
♫There will always be a place for us to meet♫

00:37:36.400 --> 00:37:38.910 line:0%
♫I want to be with you forever♫

00:37:39.400 --> 00:37:42.680 line:0%
♫When our black hair turns grey♫

00:37:42.920 --> 00:37:45.320 line:0%
♫In this life♫

00:37:45.720 --> 00:37:49.730 line:0%
♫I'll only cherish you in my heart♫

00:38:12.280 --> 00:38:13.140 line:0%
-I...
-You...

00:38:16.400 --> 00:38:17.200 line:0%
-You...
-I…

00:38:20.780 --> 00:38:21.780 line:0%
You go first.

00:38:26.520 --> 00:38:28.050 line:0%
How did you know

00:38:28.350 --> 00:38:30.830 line:0%
that woven pig was made by me?

00:38:35.530 --> 00:38:36.600 line:0%
Is this

00:38:36.600 --> 00:38:38.200 line:0%
what you've been hesitating

00:38:38.610 --> 00:38:39.700 line:0%
to ask all along?

00:38:53.680 --> 00:38:55.340 line:0%
I knew from the very beginning

00:38:55.950 --> 00:38:57.610 line:0%
that it wasn't made by Xiuxiu.

00:39:14.910 --> 00:39:16.390 line:0%
You're amazing.

00:39:16.420 --> 00:39:17.360 line:0%
I also want to make one

00:39:17.360 --> 00:39:19.440 line:0%
as a birthday gift for Brother Du.

00:39:20.120 --> 00:39:21.160 line:0%
But no matter how I try,

00:39:21.160 --> 00:39:22.560 line:0%
it always turns out ugly.

00:39:23.780 --> 00:39:24.940 line:0%
Can you...

00:39:25.350 --> 00:39:27.230 line:0%
swap with me?

00:39:27.680 --> 00:39:28.920 line:0%
Sure, you can have it.

00:39:30.800 --> 00:39:31.600 line:0%
Thank you.

00:39:31.600 --> 00:39:32.640 line:0%
You're so nice.

00:39:32.970 --> 00:39:37.440 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:39:33.960 --> 00:39:35.290 line:0%
On my birthday,

00:39:35.370 --> 00:39:36.830 line:0%
I received the little pig.

00:39:37.800 --> 00:39:38.960 line:0%
I originally wanted to find a reason

00:39:38.960 --> 00:39:39.800 line:0%
to thank you.

00:39:40.650 --> 00:39:44.050 line:0%
But then I learned that you had been taken away by your family.

00:39:45.990 --> 00:39:48.300 line:0%
At the time, I was so absorbed

00:39:49.140 --> 00:39:50.560 line:0%
in the happiness of knowing that my father

00:39:50.560 --> 00:39:51.760 line:0%
hadn't abandoned me.

00:39:52.480 --> 00:39:55.100 line:0%
He was late because of official business,

00:39:55.760 --> 00:39:57.980 line:0%
and I didn't notice anything else.

00:39:59.730 --> 00:40:00.850 line:0%
I never expected

00:40:03.200 --> 00:40:05.400 line:0%
that you would still keep the woven pig.

00:40:08.160 --> 00:40:08.960 line:0%
Later,

00:40:10.610 --> 00:40:12.470 line:0%
the Shen family was confiscated.

00:40:13.670 --> 00:40:14.840 line:0%
This woven pig

00:40:14.840 --> 00:40:15.880 line:0%
became one of the few things

00:40:15.880 --> 00:40:17.320 line:0%
that could be kept.

00:40:19.520 --> 00:40:21.050 line:0%
So, I've kept it ever since.

00:40:23.180 --> 00:40:24.710 line:0%
It reminds me

00:40:25.860 --> 00:40:27.240 line:0%
of the good times when my father

00:40:27.240 --> 00:40:28.500 line:0%
taught me how to weave.

00:40:33.830 --> 00:40:35.900 line:0%
It was only recently that I learned

00:40:36.580 --> 00:40:38.710 line:0%
that this Sixth Lady is Sixth Lady Yan.

00:40:49.670 --> 00:40:51.130 line:0%
The Prisoner's Center...

00:40:53.760 --> 00:40:56.220 line:0%
You always said you would come to take me out.

00:40:57.060 --> 00:40:58.520 line:0%
Why didn't you come later?

00:41:07.150 --> 00:41:08.170 line:0%
Because

00:41:10.360 --> 00:41:12.120 line:0%
I always crawled in through the dog hole

00:41:12.120 --> 00:41:13.490 line:0%
in the back garden.

00:41:14.080 --> 00:41:15.160 line:0%
Later, they discovered

00:41:15.160 --> 00:41:16.160 line:0%
this loophole

00:41:17.160 --> 00:41:19.120 line:0%
and blocked it up.

00:41:21.180 --> 00:41:22.570 line:0%
After that,

00:41:23.890 --> 00:41:26.220 line:0%
you didn't need me to take you out anymore.

00:41:31.290 --> 00:41:32.190 line:0%
Thank you.

00:41:40.250 --> 00:41:42.280 line:0%
You came to take me home anyway.